            <ArticleTitle>Naloxone-resistant respiratory depression and neurological eye symptoms after intrathecal morphine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>432-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of neurological symptoms after the intrathecal use of an opioid. These symptoms were not reversible by the use of an opioid-antagonist.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
